[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: L2 — Product Requirements
UID: QMGMT-L2
VERSION: 0.1
OPTIONS:
  MARKUP: RST
  AUTO_LEVELS: On

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: requirements.sgra

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Qube lifecycle

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-LIFECYCLE-01
TITLE: Qube creation
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall create a qube of a caller-specified class from a
caller-specified template.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_create

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-LIFECYCLE-02
TITLE: Qube cloning
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall create a new qube as a copy of an existing qube,
including that qube's configuration.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_create
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_volume_clone_to

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-LIFECYCLE-03
TITLE: Qube removal
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall remove a qube together with its storage volumes.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_remove

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-LIFECYCLE-04
TITLE: Qube start
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall start a halted qube and report completion only once
that qube is running.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_start

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-LIFECYCLE-05
TITLE: Qube shutdown and kill
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall bring a running qube to the halted state by a
caller-selected graceful shutdown or forced kill.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_shutdown
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_kill

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-LIFECYCLE-06
TITLE: Qube pause and resume
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall transition a qube between the running and paused
execution states on request.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
