TITLE: Volume revision retention
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall set the number of snapshot revisions retained for a
qube volume.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible, Salt, QubesadminTools, Terraform
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L1-IDEMPOTENT
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: File
  ROLE: Authority
  PATH: qubes-core-admin/qubes/api/admin.py
  ELEMENT: function
  ID: QubesAdminAPI.vm_volume_set_revisions_to_keep

[PRODUCT_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L2-STORAGE-03
TITLE: Storage pool selection
STATEMENT: >>>
The management tool shall place a qube's volumes in a caller-specified storage
